From: BoxDroid <boxdroid@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] tests/xbox: include Pixman dependency in PTIMER tests

Downstream status: not submitted upstream. NV2A headers include console
and Pixman headers. Declare the dependency for the standalone correctness
test, including Android cross-builds with Pixman in a nested include path.
No production timer or guest behavior changes.

diff --git a/tests/xbox/ptimer/meson.build b/tests/xbox/ptimer/meson.build
--- a/tests/xbox/ptimer/meson.build
+++ b/tests/xbox/ptimer/meson.build
@@ -13,7 +13,7 @@
   include_directories: [
     include_directories('../../../target/i386'),
   ],
-  dependencies: [qemuutil],
+  dependencies: [qemuutil, pixman],
   build_by_default: false,
 )
 
